; BeatController must be present and assigned a BeatLibrary.
@beat type:awkward
ReRe: This line gets a small pause before the next command.

@beat type:shock
ReRe: The shock preset can hide the text printer and shake the camera.

@beat type:realize
ReRe: A warm flash can underline a realization.

